{% layout "layouts/base.liquid" %}
{% block title %}Multiselect — Cubito UI Docs{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<article class="flow">

  <header class="flow" style="padding-block-end: var(--space-l); border-block-end: var(--border-s) solid var(--border-color-subtle);">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
      <ol>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/components/">Components</a></li>
        <li aria-current="page">Multiselect</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <h1>Multiselect</h1>
    <p class="text-m color-subtle">A dropdown for choosing several options, built from native <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> and checkboxes. Works with no JavaScript and submits with the form.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="callout wide color-brand" role="note">
    <p><strong>Draft.</strong> Layout is delegated to Every Layout compositions: <code>.repel</code> (trigger), <code>.flow</code> (options), <code>.cluster</code> (form actions). The component only adds the look and the state.</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-s);">
      <h2 class="heading-l">Default</h2>
      <p>Wrap a <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code> of checkboxes in a <code>&lt;details class="multiselect"&gt;</code>. The <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code> is the trigger and uses <code>.repel</code> to push the chevron to the far end. The panel floats under the trigger; the count at the bottom is rendered by CSS counters.</p>

      <div class="" style="max-inline-size: 22rem; min-block-size: 22rem;">
  <details class="multiselect">
    <summary class="repel" data-nowrap>
      <span class="multiselect__label">Colours</span>
    </summary>
    <fieldset class="multiselect__panel flow">
      <legend class="visually-hidden">Colours</legend>
      <label class="multiselect__option">
        <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="red"> Red
      </label>
      <label class="multiselect__option">
        <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="green" checked> Green
      </label>
      <label class="multiselect__option">
        <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="blue"> Blue
      </label>
      <label class="multiselect__option">
        <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="yellow"> Yellow
      </label>
      <label class="multiselect__option">
        <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="black"> Black
      </label>
      <p class="multiselect__status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </fieldset>
  </details>
      </div>

      <details class="margin-y-s">
        <summary>Show code</summary>
        <pre class="padding-m"><code>  &lt;details class=&quot;multiselect&quot;&gt;
    &lt;summary class=&quot;repel&quot; data-nowrap&gt;
      &lt;span class=&quot;multiselect__label&quot;&gt;Colours&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;/summary&gt;
    &lt;fieldset class=&quot;multiselect__panel flow&quot;&gt;
      &lt;legend class=&quot;visually-hidden&quot;&gt;Colours&lt;/legend&gt;
      &lt;label class=&quot;multiselect__option&quot;&gt;
        &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; name=&quot;colour&quot; value=&quot;red&quot;&gt; Red
      &lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;label class=&quot;multiselect__option&quot;&gt;
        &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; name=&quot;colour&quot; value=&quot;green&quot; checked&gt; Green
      &lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;label class=&quot;multiselect__option&quot;&gt;
        &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; name=&quot;colour&quot; value=&quot;blue&quot;&gt; Blue
      &lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;label class=&quot;multiselect__option&quot;&gt;
        &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; name=&quot;colour&quot; value=&quot;yellow&quot;&gt; Yellow
      &lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;label class=&quot;multiselect__option&quot;&gt;
