    &lt;/fieldset&gt;
  &lt;/details&gt;</code></pre>
      </details>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-s);">
      <h2 class="heading-l">Inside a form</h2>
      <p>The options are real checkboxes, so every checked value is submitted under the same <code>name</code> and <code>FormData.getAll()</code> returns them all. Use <code>.cluster</code> to line up the control and the submit button.</p>

      <div class="" style="">
  <form class="flow" style="max-inline-size: 22rem;" onsubmit="return false">
    <label for="ms-note">Label
      <input id="ms-note" type="text" placeholder="Summer collection">
    </label>
    <details class="multiselect" data-variant="inline">
      <summary class="repel" data-nowrap>
        <span class="multiselect__label">Colours</span>
      </summary>
      <fieldset class="multiselect__panel flow">
        <legend class="visually-hidden">Colours</legend>
        <label class="multiselect__option">
          <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="red" checked> Red
        </label>
        <label class="multiselect__option">
          <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="green"> Green
        </label>
        <label class="multiselect__option">
          <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="blue" checked> Blue
        </label>
        <label class="multiselect__option">
          <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="yellow"> Yellow
        </label>
        <label class="multiselect__option">
          <input type="checkbox" name="colour" value="black"> Black
        </label>
        <p class="multiselect__status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </fieldset>
    </details>
    <div class="cluster">
      <button type="submit">Apply</button>
      <button type="reset" data-variant="outline">Clear</button>
    </div>
  </form>
      </div>

