  <section>
    <div class="flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-s);">
      <h2 class="heading-l">Optional close behaviour</h2>
      <p>Native <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> does not close on outside click or <kbd>Esc</kbd>. The CSS does not need it, but if you want it, this is the whole script.</p>

      <div class="" style="">
  <p class="text-s color-subtle">Not a live demo — paste it once per page.</p>
      </div>

      <details class="margin-y-s">
        <summary>Show code</summary>
        <pre class="padding-m"><code>document.addEventListener(&#x27;click&#x27;, (e) =&gt; {
  document.querySelectorAll(&#x27;.multiselect[open]&#x27;).forEach((d) =&gt; {
    if (!d.contains(e.target)) d.open = false;
  });
});
document.addEventListener(&#x27;keydown&#x27;, (e) =&gt; {
  if (e.key !== &#x27;Escape&#x27;) return;
  document.querySelectorAll(&#x27;.multiselect[open]&#x27;).forEach((d) =&gt; {
    d.open = false;
    d.querySelector(&#x27;summary&#x27;).focus();
  });
});</code></pre>
      </details>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-s);">
      <h2 class="heading-l">Tokens</h2>
      <p>The trigger reuses the <a href="/base/form">form</a> tokens (<code>--input-default-*</code>), so it always matches neighbouring inputs. Every token above also exists without <code>-default-</code> (for example <code>--multiselect-panel-radius</code>) as an optional local override.</p>
      <table class="">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Token</th>
            <th>Default</th>
            <th>Description</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-panel-background</code></td>
            <td><code>var(--surface)</code></td>
            <td>Panel fill.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-panel-border</code></td>
            <td><code>solid var(--border-s) var(--border-color)</code></td>
            <td>Panel border shorthand.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-panel-radius</code></td>
            <td><code>var(--border-radius-m)</code></td>
            <td>Panel corner radius.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-panel-shadow</code></td>
            <td><code>layered shadow</code></td>
            <td>Shadow of the floating panel (removed by the inline variant).</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-panel-padding</code></td>
            <td><code>var(--space-xxs)</code></td>
            <td>Space between the panel edge and the options.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-max-block-size</code></td>
            <td><code>min(20rem, 60dvh)</code></td>
            <td>Height at which the option list starts to scroll.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-option-background-hover</code></td>
            <td><code>var(--surface-sunken)</code></td>
            <td>Option fill on hover.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-option-background-selected</code></td>
            <td><code>brand 12% over var(--surface)</code></td>
            <td>Fill of a checked option.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-label-color</code></td>
            <td><code>var(--text-muted)</code></td>
            <td>Trigger text while nothing is selected.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-label-color-selected</code></td>
            <td><code>var(--text)</code></td>
            <td>Trigger text once something is selected (also bold).</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-status-color</code></td>
            <td><code>var(--text-muted)</code></td>
            <td>Colour of the count line.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-status-text</code></td>
            <td><code>&quot; selected&quot;</code></td>
            <td>Text after the number — change it to localise.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>--multiselect-default-chevron-size</code></td>
            <td><code>1em</code></td>
            <td>Chevron size.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
